- **Builders:** `/Users/vasu/Documents/git/charts-backend/a2ui/chart_builder.py` (line 19-28 `_wrap()` function)
- **Tools:** `/Users/vasu/Documents/git/charts-backend/tools/a2ui_tools.py` (lines 57-296)
- **Schema:** `/Users/vasu/Documents/git/charts-backend/a2ui/schema.py` (lines 19-51)
